{
  "inShort": "The devlog and linked media leave the playable slice at risk. No build or playtest notes were shared, so progress toward the playable goal remains unknown. With Mia unconfirmed for two weeks, co-op sailing lacks confirmed engineering support beyond Alex’s contribution.",
  "discussed": [
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtpjxda025k6nz8n9r6jcyi",
      "text": "The public repository contains Godot demos, an MIT license, and import instructions. It closes the repository task, but does not show this game’s playable slice."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtpjxfc025l6nz8o4bz37a0",
      "text": "The animated reference video remains done. Its title and thumbnail identify Big Buck Bunny. The video was not watched, so its animated style could not be verified."
    },
    {
      "itemId": "cmvtpjxg0025m6nz8kf8270mn",
      "text": "The linked article explains playtesting and its formats, closing the reference task. It does not provide findings from this game’s five players."
    }
  ],
  "notDiscussed": [],
  "outsidePlan": [
    "The devlog reports five players testing the tide loop. That would advance the goal, but neither the build nor the named playtest document was shared. The landscape image shows no tide mechanic. The linked film’s title and thumbnail show an art reference, not sailing. Nothing shown establishes two islands, a route-changing tide, co-op sailing, or player findings."
  ],
  "questions": [
    "Where can the team now open the tested build and the five-player notes?"
  ]
}

